msgstr "Token je uložený."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:668
msgid "Each website needs its own token."
msgstr "Každý web potrebuje vlastný token."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:670
msgid "Downloads and lists payments, changes nothing."
msgstr "Sťahuje a vypisuje platby, nič nemení."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:671
msgid "Paid orders move to “Processing” and the customer gets the usual e-mail."
msgstr "Zaplatené objednávky prejdú do stavu „Spracováva sa“ a zákazník dostane bežný e-mail."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:672
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Režim"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:673
msgid "Token valid until"
msgstr "Token platí do"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:673
msgid "Shown in Fio internet banking next to the token. Filled in as +180 days when you save a new token. You get an e-mail and an admin notice 14 days before it expires."
msgstr "Nájdete ho v internetbankingu Fio pri tokene. Pri uložení nového tokenu sa vyplní +180 dní. 14 dní vopred príde e-mail a upozornenie v administrácii."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:675
msgid "Other Fio accounts"
msgstr "Ďalšie účty Fio"

#. translators: %s: date and time
#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:680
#, php-format
msgid "Last called by cron: %s"
msgstr "Cron naposledy zavolal: %s"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:681
msgid "Not called by cron yet. Until then the WordPress scheduler runs the checks."
msgstr "Cron zatiaľ nevolal. Dovtedy kontroly spúšťa plánovač WordPressu."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:683
msgid "Create a new address"
msgstr "Vytvoriť novú adresu"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:684
msgid "Automatic checks"
msgstr "Automatická kontrola"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:684
msgid "Most reliable: let your hosting’s cron open this address every 15 minutes (e.g. Blueboard → Cron). The daily summary runs through it too. Without it, the WordPress scheduler is used, which runs only when someone visits the site. Keep the address private."
msgstr "Najspoľahlivejšie je nechať cron hostingu otvárať túto adresu každých 15 minút (napr. v administrácii hostingu → Cron). Spúšťa aj denný prehľad. Bez neho sa použije plánovač WordPressu, ktorý beží len pri návšteve webu. Adresu nikomu neposielajte."

