msgid "Payment methods"
msgstr "Platobné metódy"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:691
msgid "Usually only bank transfer. The plugin marks an order as paid only if the customer chose one of these."
msgstr "Zvyčajne len platba prevodom. Plugin označí objednávku ako zaplatenú, len ak zákazník zvolil jednu z vybraných metód."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:692
msgid "Order status"
msgstr "Stav objednávky"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:692
msgid "Orders in these statuses are waiting for the money."
msgstr "Objednávky v týchto stavoch čakajú na peniaze."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:695
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Pokročilé nastavenia"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:699
msgid "Other statuses"
msgstr "Ďalšie stavy"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:699
msgid "Only if your shop uses its own status for orders waiting for payment."
msgstr "Len ak e-shop používa pre objednávky čakajúce na platbu vlastný stav."

#. translators: %s: meta key
#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:702
msgid "Where the order number is stored"
msgstr "Kde je uložené číslo objednávky"

#. translators: %s: meta key
#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:702
#, php-format
msgid "Leave as it is. Only for plugins that give orders their own numbers (usually %s). The variable symbol is also compared with the order ID."
msgstr "Nechajte, ako je. Týka sa len pluginov, ktoré objednávkam dávajú vlastné čísla (zvyčajne %s). Variabilný symbol sa porovnáva aj s ID objednávky."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:703
msgid "Look for payments from the last"
msgstr "Hľadať platby za posledných"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:703
msgid "days"
msgstr "dní"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:703
msgid "3 days are enough for everyday use. More only when comparing with older payments."
msgstr "Na bežnú prevádzku stačia 3 dni. Viac len pri porovnávaní so staršími platbami."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:709
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Upozornenia"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:711
msgid "Notification e-mail"
msgstr "E-mail na upozornenia"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:711
msgid "Gets underpayments, overpayments, payments to review and an alert when matching stops working."
msgstr "Prídu sem nedoplatky, preplatky, platby na kontrolu a upozornenie, keď párovanie prestane fungovať."

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:712
msgid "Daily summary"
msgstr "Denný prehľad"

#: includes/class-pmfio-admin.php:712
msgid "Every morning at 7:00 send payments from the last 24 hours and orders waiting for payment for more than 3 days"
msgstr "Každé ráno o 7:00 poslať platby za posledných 24 hodín a objednávky, ktoré čakajú na platbu dlhšie ako 3 dni"

